#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:5
#: 16f418349f4b49a5b223512324175576
msgid "Configuration Values for Common Airframes"
msgstr "常见机架的配置值"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:7
#: d343978200094ac490c306966af44cbd
msgid ""
"This page provides some approximate configuration values for common "
"airframes."
msgstr "本页提供了常见机架的部分近似配置值。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:12
#: 6e397dbc946148e49409eca1757e6fac
msgid ""
"These values are good enough to “get you off the ground”. For optimum "
"performance you will still need to tune these parameters for your aircraft."
msgstr "这些值足以「让您起飞」。若要达到最优性能，仍需针对您的飞机对这些参数进行调参。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:17
#: f411b7e7cd1d4344ab229c7210b14c05
msgid "Configuration values - not complete files"
msgstr "配置值——非完整配置文件"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:19
#: 7b294de51a98425f94c66502479b9bcd
msgid ""
"We do not not provide complete configuration files because we do not want to"
" encourage sharing complete configuration files between APM users."
msgstr "我们不提供完整的配置文件，因为我们不希望鼓励 APM 用户之间共享完整配置文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:23
#: 70afb8c060d74cb7a27e9955f769def9
msgid ""
"Sharing configuration files is often a bad idea because the correct settings"
" for a specific plane are dependent on a lot more factors than just what "
"base airframe type is being used:"
msgstr "共享配置文件通常不是个好主意，因为特定飞机的正确设置取决于远不止机架类型这一个因素："

#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:27
#: 90a88318e8bd40cda82c671cc1249ce6
msgid ""
"the right tuning values depends on what type of servos you have installed "
"(different servos respond at different speeds), and which hole in the servo "
"horns you connect the control arms to"
msgstr "正确的调参值取决于您安装的舵机类型（不同舵机的响应速度不同），以及连接操纵臂的舵机摇臂上的孔位"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:30
#: 3b9567243f184f8b9d0dd63592fc1a0e
msgid ""
"the right values also depend on your RC transmitter setup, especially the "
"range of movement of each control axis"
msgstr "正确的值还取决于您的遥控器设置，尤其是每个控制轴的运动范围"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:32
#: ef58fba6d01d4bc3b9e64738aacd346c
msgid ""
"the right tuning values also depend on what motor and battery you have "
"installed, and depends a lot on the total takeoff weight of your aircraft. "
"If one user has a camera installed and another user doesn't then they will "
"probably need different tuning values."
msgstr ""
"正确的调参值还取决于您安装的电机和电池，并且在很大程度上取决于飞机的总起飞重量。如果一位用户安装了摄像头而另一位没有，他们可能需要不同的调参值。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:36
#: 0c4fbd3a84f648b0b83f8f9738b8219b
msgid ""
"manufacturers often make changes to airframes, servos and motors without re-"
"branding the airframe as a new model. Sometimes they even change the "
"direction that servos move"
msgstr "制造商经常在不更新机架型号的情况下更改机架、舵机和电机。有时他们甚至会改变舵机的运动方向"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:39
#: 7390259247d9445eaf120610e7a983ce
msgid ""
"different users have different optional sensors, which changes what "
"configuration options are needed. For example, some users install an "
"airspeed sensor or an external compass."
msgstr "不同用户拥有不同的可选传感器，这会改变所需的配置选项。例如，部分用户安装了空速传感器或外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:42
#: 8df9fe624ebe49e5b48ef3710064818a
msgid ""
"new Ardupilot firmware releases frequently change the defaults for some "
"critical parameters to avoid problems found by users. If you load a config "
"file from a user of an older firmware then that will revert those changes"
msgstr ""
"新版 ArduPilot 固件发布时，经常会更改部分关键参数的默认值，以避免用户遇到的问题。若您加载来自旧版固件用户的配置文件，这些更改将被还原"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:47
#: cf53f7ba7bf64d27ba8d95b1696735a4
msgid ""
"For all of these reasons you should not just download a configuration file "
"from another user and expect it to work."
msgstr "基于上述所有原因，您不应直接下载其他用户的配置文件并期望其正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:51
#: d34bdb33cc58455c8f6f51ae8c1714ad
msgid "So what can you do?"
msgstr "那么您能做什么？"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:53
#: d0959bf9250b4fcab365467dd5bdb852
msgid ""
"If another user has tuned a similar aircraft, then you can look in their "
"configuration file to find the key tuning parameter they used, and manually "
"put those values into your APM as a starting point for tuning. The key "
"parameters you should look for are:"
msgstr ""
"如果其他用户已对类似飞机进行了调参，您可以查看其配置文件中的关键调参参数，并手动将这些值输入您的 APM 作为调参的起点。您应重点关注的关键参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:58
#: 09e3f2795df84d409e7e73204a374f2e
msgid "``RLL2SRV_P``"
msgstr "``RLL2SRV_P``"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:59
