#: c804ed63c2644437839e5ce23e5d84a7
msgid ":ref:`NAVL1_PERIOD <NAVL1_PERIOD>`"
msgstr ":ref:`NAVL1_PERIOD <NAVL1_PERIOD>`"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:62
#: a9573f1a21df4ca0b1ecfec374e3d785
msgid ""
"Setting those to an approximately correct value will give you a reasonable "
"starting point for tuning your airframe. After that you should follow the "
":ref:`tuning guide <roll-pitch-controller-tuning>`."
msgstr ""
"将这些参数设置为近似正确的值，将为您的机架调参提供合理的起点。之后您应遵循 :ref:`调参指南 <roll-pitch-controller-"
"tuning>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:66
#: fef1f33285f1403381b5721c5d904d26
msgid ""
"Also note that the Plane parameters default to zero 'I' values. The reason "
"for this is that you need to tune the P value first, then tune the I value. "
"If you put in a non-zero I value when the P value is a long way off the "
"aircraft may oscillate badly and could crash."
msgstr ""
"另请注意，固定翼参数的「I」值默认为零。这是因为您需要先调整 P 值，再调整 I 值。若在 P 值相差较大时输入非零的 I "
"值，飞机可能会严重振荡甚至坠机。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:71
#: fef1a58166f84df6b4baad82907076af
msgid ""
"Once you have good P values then you should raise the I values a bit, as "
"described in the tuning guide. That will allow APM to cope better with wind."
" For example, once the P values are setup correctly then setting the "
"following will help with most aircraft:"
msgstr ""
"一旦获得较好的 P 值，应适当提高 I 值，如调参指南中所述。这将使 APM 更好地应对风的干扰。例如，当 P "
"值设置正确后，以下设置将对大多数飞机有所帮助："

#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:76
#: 27ab69860fbb47a9a16922ad9cd3c009
