#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:100
#: 636460e527eb4ac2ade290587f50aff2
msgid "Bixler Tips"
msgstr "Bixler 使用技巧"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:102
#: a8b4e3e213d34ed690dc892b78ced6af
msgid ""
"See `this posting <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/mounting-an-apm-on-"
"a-bixler2-upside-down-using-ahrs-orientation>`__ for how to fit an APM to a "
"Bixler2. Also see :ref:`High Quality Bixler 1.1 Build (APM2.x) <a-high-"
"quality-bixler-1-1-build>`."
msgstr ""
"请参阅 `此帖子 <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/mounting-an-apm-on-a-"
"bixler2-upside-down-using-ahrs-orientation>`__ 了解如何将 APM 安装到 Bixler2 上。另请参阅 "
":ref:`高品质 Bixler 1.1 构建（APM2.x）<a-high-quality-bixler-1-1-build>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:105
#: 19bf85e514074ae6aafbf9f48398f549
msgid ""
"Heavy Bixler's fly much faster and are prone to tip stalling if slowed up "
"too much, so keep things as light as possible! A stall in FBWA can be tricky"
" to get out of. Autopilots do not handle stalls well."
msgstr ""
"重载 Bixler 飞行速度更快，速度过低时容易发生翼尖失速，因此请尽量保持轻量！在 FBWA 模式下失速可能难以改出。飞控对失速的处理能力有限。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:109
#: 03ed9b31c43e44e5b6456241639896c8
msgid ""
"Set manual level with a little bit of positive pitch - take your time to set"
" this, fly and repeat as many times as it takes to get a super stable "
"cruising speed with the lowest throttle setting possible. It takes a little "
"while to work out what pitch and throttle combination give the most stable "
"cruising flight. Set closer to 50% throttle for cruise (but obviously "
"depends on your set up)."
msgstr ""
"设置手动水平飞行时给予少量正俯仰——请花时间仔细设置，反复飞行调整，直到以尽可能低的油门设置获得超稳定的巡航速度。需要一段时间才能找出最稳定巡航飞行所需的俯仰和油门组合。巡航油门设置接近"
" 50%（当然具体取决于您的配置）。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:115
#: 5f73ee50caa84cf8affc41eebcb6407c
msgid ""
"Perform some test flights in FBWA mode and figure out minimum throttle "
"setting /speed that is still stable. You can \"feel\" a tip stall coming "
"with enough practice. To recover from the stall, change quickly to Manual "
"mode and then: wings level and pull out slowly. Test with enough height to "
"see how fast the plane needs to be going in each mode. Also be sure to "
"always add sufficient throttle when heading downwind to keep airspeed up."
msgstr ""
"在 FBWA 模式下进行一些试飞，找出最低油门设置/仍能保持稳定的速度。经过足够练习，您能「感受到」翼尖失速的来临。失速改出时，迅速切换至 Manual"
" 模式，然后：保持机翼水平，缓慢拉出。以足够高度进行测试，以了解飞机在各模式下需要多快的速度。同时务必在顺风飞行时增加足够的油门以保持空速。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:122
#: 2d932855d600448f99aecac35074b4a9
msgid ""
"If you prefer to keep the airframe flat you can, in FBWA mode, use only "
"rudder for turning. APM does a great job of keeping the the plane level in "
"turns (with proper speed of course)."
msgstr "如果您希望保持机架平飞，可在 FBWA 模式下仅使用方向舵转弯。APM 在转弯时能很好地保持飞机水平（当然需要适当速度）。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:125
#: e2119219840d4fe4aaef90e48505ef87
msgid ""
"Make sure that target throttle in full autopilot mode is 10% above throttle "
"settings that were figured out using methods above for mission cruising."
msgstr "确保在全自动飞行模式下的目标油门比上述方法确定的任务巡航油门设置高出 10%。"

#: ../../source/docs/configuration-files-for-common-airframes.rst:128
#: f7b7bbaecc5a4d9ab74b06fa4d9f7c25
msgid ""
"If setting a target speed in auto make sure it's fast enough for the plane "
"and its payload."
msgstr "若在自动模式下设置目标速度，请确保该速度对飞机及其有效载荷足够快。"

